<newsitem itemid="555485" id="root" date="1997-05-02" xml:lang="en">
<title>ZIMBABWE: Coal producer Wankie lifts year earnings.</title>
<headline>Coal producer Wankie lifts year earnings.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for year to February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>	    (million Zimbabwe dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		   27.5     vs 22.5</p>
<p>    Final div (cts)	   20.0     vs  15.0</p>
<p>    Pre-interest profit    179.2     vs 125.4</p>
<p>    Net interest		 2.0     vs  28.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   181.3     vs 153.7</p>
<p>    Tax			   63.9     vs  56.1</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	 117.3     vs  97.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		   835.9     vs 665.1</p>
<p>Div payable on June 12</p>
<p>on register May 23</p>
<p>Full name: Wankie Colliery Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it expected demand for coal and coke to remain firm.</p>
<p>Harare Newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9.</p>
</text>
